WEBVTT

00:35.754 --> 00:40.754
Subtitles by explosiveskull

01:16.257 --> 01:21.787
<i>There is a place
like no other on Earth.</i>

01:21.796 --> 01:24.896
<i>A land full of wonder,</i>

01:24.899 --> 01:26.369
<i>mystery,</i>

01:26.367 --> 01:27.637
<i>and danger.</i>

01:30.271 --> 01:33.871
<i>Some say to survive it,</i>

01:33.875 --> 01:37.905
<i>you need to be
as mad as a hatter,</i>

01:37.912 --> 01:40.752
<i>which luckily...</i>

01:40.748 --> 01:42.418
<i>I am.</i>

01:48.357 --> 01:51.387
Bless me, Father,
for I have sinned.

01:51.393 --> 01:52.863
Easy, sweetheart.

01:58.399 --> 02:01.639
I don't think you're
supposed to smoke in here.

02:01.637 --> 02:03.367
Guess I've sinned
again then.

02:03.372 --> 02:05.942
What is it that you want?

02:12.414 --> 02:14.754
You know exactly what I want.

02:14.749 --> 02:19.389
I want your work,
your contracts, all of it.

02:19.387 --> 02:21.417
I'm afraid
you're out of luck.

02:21.422 --> 02:25.892
I've been recommended another
interested party to handle my...

02:25.893 --> 02:28.433
liquidations.

02:28.429 --> 02:31.299
I'll make you a wager.

02:31.300 --> 02:34.770
These other interested parties,

02:34.769 --> 02:38.369
I'll set them on one another
like starving rats in a cage,

02:38.374 --> 02:40.844
and you can
watch through the bars.

02:40.843 --> 02:42.383
Give me a fortnight.

02:42.378 --> 02:44.538
I'll have them both dead
at your feet.

02:44.546 --> 02:47.876
If I win, I get your work.

02:47.882 --> 02:49.282
All of it.

02:49.285 --> 02:51.845
If you win,

02:51.854 --> 02:55.524
you get to make me the
interested party that's dead.

02:55.523 --> 02:57.793
Deal?

02:57.792 --> 02:59.392
Deal.

02:59.394 --> 03:00.804
Wait.

03:02.530 --> 03:05.300
I need a little favor.

03:05.301 --> 03:08.401
I need you
to find someone for me.

04:37.425 --> 04:39.355
Let the games begin.

05:13.028 --> 05:15.728
Filet steaks and a robust red
for supper, is it?

05:15.730 --> 05:17.000
Fuck off, you punk.

05:16.999 --> 05:19.129
Don't do that.
It's dangerous.

05:19.134 --> 05:21.134
I've got an open blade here.

05:21.136 --> 05:23.906
Stick it in your mouth.
Maybe it will keep you quiet.

05:27.975 --> 05:29.775
Why are you shaving?

05:29.778 --> 05:31.178
Two weeks we've been in here
all day and all night,

05:31.179 --> 05:32.949
and suddenly
you're putting your face on.

05:32.948 --> 05:33.948
What's all that about?

05:33.949 --> 05:36.119
I've got a date later.

05:36.117 --> 05:38.947
Have you? Bollocks.

05:38.953 --> 05:41.823
Only date you've got is with
a camp bed and your right hand,

05:41.824 --> 05:43.764
you wanker.

06:24.633 --> 06:27.273
No trains till tomorrow now.

06:27.268 --> 06:29.238
404 going north,

06:29.237 --> 06:32.167
calling all stations
until termination.

06:32.174 --> 06:34.044
Have a pleasant trip.

06:34.042 --> 06:36.742
I'm not going north.
I just need a train.

06:36.744 --> 06:37.914
Train?

06:39.614 --> 06:41.114
- Yes.
- Where you going?

06:41.115 --> 06:42.945
Nowhere.
I just need a train.

06:42.951 --> 06:44.821
- Why?
- Never you mind!

06:44.819 --> 06:46.989
There's no need for rudeness.

06:50.792 --> 06:53.192
I'm so sorry.
That was, um...

06:53.194 --> 06:54.734
That was unnecessary.

06:54.730 --> 06:57.230
A man...

06:57.232 --> 06:58.802
who needs a train...

06:58.800 --> 07:01.600
but not the journey...

07:01.602 --> 07:04.042
is a man with a problem.

07:04.038 --> 07:05.698
Indeed.

07:05.706 --> 07:07.236
Are there any freight trains
coming through here

07:07.242 --> 07:09.582
- between now and then?
- Naw.

07:09.578 --> 07:11.008
No freight trains here.

07:11.013 --> 07:12.853
Of course.

07:12.848 --> 07:14.108
Yeah.

07:14.115 --> 07:16.675
404 going north,

07:16.684 --> 07:21.994
calling all stations
until termination.

07:21.989 --> 07:24.089
Well, the 404
seems like an age away,

07:24.091 --> 07:26.761
and it's not time
I'm trying to kill.

07:30.232 --> 07:32.872
End of the Line Cafe

07:32.867 --> 07:35.167
situated on
the station concourse,

07:35.170 --> 07:37.200
open 24 hours a day.

07:37.204 --> 07:41.274
Why not purchase one of
our delicious sticky buns?

07:41.275 --> 07:43.175
Only 30 pence.

07:43.177 --> 07:44.737
You're peculiar.

07:44.746 --> 07:47.606
And you're staring
at an empty platform

07:47.615 --> 07:51.175
in a deserted station
in the middle of the night,

07:51.186 --> 07:56.056
waiting for a train
that isn't coming.

07:57.292 --> 07:59.262
Touché.

07:59.261 --> 08:01.761
End of the Line it is.

08:27.254 --> 08:29.394
Give us your money,
you old bastard, or I'll do you!

08:29.391 --> 08:31.291
What? No! Absolutely not!

08:31.292 --> 08:33.392
- You think I'm kidding?
- I didn't say that.

08:33.395 --> 08:36.125
I just feel like
you lack preparation is all.

08:37.199 --> 08:38.729
How's this for preparation?

08:38.733 --> 08:42.273
Now give him your wallet
and your watch. Now!

08:42.270 --> 08:44.640
I'll tell you what.
I'll buy the gun off you.

08:44.640 --> 08:46.310
I've got a fiver here,
a crisp five pound note.

08:46.308 --> 08:47.908
Take it or leave it.

08:47.909 --> 08:49.909
Raymond, hurry up!

08:49.910 --> 08:51.140
What do you want me
to do, Lenny?

08:51.146 --> 08:53.376
- He's not cooperating.
- Lenny?

08:53.381 --> 08:55.051
- You are?
- Raymond.

08:55.050 --> 08:56.980
Raymond. Now listen to me
very, very carefully.

08:56.984 --> 08:59.354
I've made what I believe to be
a perfectly reasonable offer.

08:59.353 --> 09:01.253
Now you're going
to make a few quid,

09:01.256 --> 09:02.356
and I'm in need of a gun.

09:02.357 --> 09:03.987
Now, is it loaded?

09:03.992 --> 09:05.262
What do you mean,
is it loaded?

09:05.260 --> 09:07.130
I mean, are there
any bullets in it?

09:07.128 --> 09:09.158
Of course it's loaded!

09:09.164 --> 09:10.634
Really?

09:12.700 --> 09:13.900
No, it's not loaded.

09:13.901 --> 09:15.171
- Ah.
- Ray!

09:15.170 --> 09:16.870
- For Christ's sakes!
- What?

09:16.872 --> 09:17.902
It's not, is it?

09:17.905 --> 09:19.705
This is ridiculous.

09:19.708 --> 09:21.068
- Hey, where you going?
- Stay there you or I'll...

09:21.075 --> 09:22.435
Or what? What, Lenny?

09:22.444 --> 09:25.384
You going to butter me
to death?

09:25.380 --> 09:27.950
I'm very disappointed
in both of you.

09:27.949 --> 09:30.979
You've let me down,
and you've let yourselves down.

09:30.986 --> 09:33.216
Something to think about,
isn't it?

09:33.221 --> 09:34.661
Good night.

09:37.992 --> 09:39.932
Fucking piss me off sometimes,
you do.

09:39.928 --> 09:41.828
Why did you tell him
there were no bullets for?

10:06.987 --> 10:08.187
You can't smoke in here.

10:11.859 --> 10:13.829
Well, there's
no one else in here.

10:13.828 --> 10:16.498
They're not smoking either,
are they?

10:16.497 --> 10:21.267
Can I have another cup
of coffee then? This one's cold.

10:21.269 --> 10:24.339
That's because you've been
playing with it for 20 minutes.

10:24.338 --> 10:27.268
- Can I have another one?
- Sure. 40 pence.

10:27.275 --> 10:28.935
Have a heart.
I just got mugged.

10:28.944 --> 10:31.984
39 then.
I'm in a giving mood.

10:35.050 --> 10:37.190
So shines a good deed
in a naughty world.

10:38.453 --> 10:40.193
Naughty?

10:40.188 --> 10:43.118
As in spank me gently,
I've been a naughty girl?

10:43.125 --> 10:46.155
No, not that kind of naughty.

10:46.160 --> 10:49.260
As in tie me to the bedposts
because I've been so naughty?

10:49.264 --> 10:52.334
I think that qualifies
as the same kind of naughty.

10:52.333 --> 10:54.033
I know.

10:54.035 --> 10:57.735
I just enjoy watching you fidget
when I say "naughty."

10:59.875 --> 11:02.165
Have we met before?

11:02.176 --> 11:04.876
Why? Do I look familiar?

11:08.415 --> 11:10.915
Are you all right?

11:10.919 --> 11:13.189
Do you need your medicine?

11:13.188 --> 11:15.488
Well, tell me which one.

11:15.490 --> 11:17.320
You've got to be kidding me.

11:17.324 --> 11:19.464
Medicinal purposes.

11:19.460 --> 11:21.860
Nice. Go on then.

11:34.275 --> 11:35.835
How about that coffee?

11:51.126 --> 11:52.856
Listen to this.

11:52.861 --> 11:54.561
"Curvaceous,
cream-skinned belle

11:54.563 --> 11:57.533
seeks sleek Romeo
for candlelit romance

11:57.531 --> 11:59.571
and walks in the moonlight.

11:59.568 --> 12:01.998
City based."

12:02.002 --> 12:04.202
See, that's code, that is.

12:04.205 --> 12:06.905
That's deviants' code.
Pervert poetry.

12:08.309 --> 12:11.109
Translates to "Fat bird
wants outside seeing-to

12:11.112 --> 12:12.952
late at night." See?

12:12.948 --> 12:15.108
Well, that is funny.

12:15.116 --> 12:17.576
"Slight, retiring
young gentleman

12:17.585 --> 12:21.985
seeks decisive, practical lady
to draw him from his shell.

12:21.990 --> 12:25.490
Friendship and romance.
Suburban residence."

12:25.492 --> 12:27.362
Translation:

12:27.362 --> 12:29.462
Skinny pencil-dick
seeks dominatrix

12:29.463 --> 12:31.233
for abuse and humiliation.

12:31.232 --> 12:33.132
Has own dungeon.

12:33.133 --> 12:35.173
World's gone to shit,
and all anyone can think about

12:35.170 --> 12:39.270
is their next dirty one
down the docks.

12:39.274 --> 12:41.614
There it is, though.

12:41.609 --> 12:45.549
There it is
in black and white.

12:58.559 --> 13:00.629
So...

13:00.628 --> 13:02.898
what's wrong with you?

13:02.897 --> 13:04.457
I beg your pardon?

13:04.466 --> 13:07.166
You're hardly the picture
of health. What's wrong?

13:07.168 --> 13:08.568
You don't want to know.

13:08.569 --> 13:10.399
I'm fascinated.

13:10.405 --> 13:13.065
- Tell me.
- What's wrong with you?

13:13.074 --> 13:16.614
I have an unquenchable bloodlust
for darkness and depravity.

13:16.611 --> 13:18.581
That's nice.

13:18.579 --> 13:19.949
Is it cancer?

13:19.948 --> 13:22.448
No, no.

13:22.449 --> 13:26.049
Has anyone ever introduced you
to the concept of small talk?

13:26.054 --> 13:29.394
Well, what is it
if it's not cancer?

13:29.391 --> 13:31.191
They don't know.

13:31.192 --> 13:33.332
No way.

13:33.328 --> 13:35.288
That is brilliant.

13:35.296 --> 13:36.996
You're a bit odd, aren't you?

13:36.997 --> 13:39.597
Unquestionably, but death
is by far the best bit.

13:39.601 --> 13:41.631
- Of what?
- Of life!

13:41.636 --> 13:44.066
Did you read that
in a birthday card?

13:44.072 --> 13:45.612
You're funny.

13:47.107 --> 13:49.637
All right,
let's examine the facts.

13:49.644 --> 13:53.484
It's terminal, your sides hurt,
and you cough badly.

13:53.481 --> 13:55.381
All signs point to
malignant tumor damage.

13:55.382 --> 13:57.522
You're not in denial about it,
are you?

13:57.519 --> 14:01.219
You're not desperately searching
for another explanation?

14:01.222 --> 14:03.322
I'm dying?

14:03.324 --> 14:05.034
Yeah.

14:06.227 --> 14:08.327
No, thanks.

14:08.329 --> 14:12.669
But you don't know...
why or how?

14:14.401 --> 14:15.401
No.

14:15.402 --> 14:17.602
Will it be painful?

14:17.604 --> 14:19.404
Oh, no.

14:19.406 --> 14:23.106
Well, how can you be sure?

14:23.111 --> 14:24.481
Painkillers.

14:28.550 --> 14:30.080
Is there anything else?

14:32.520 --> 14:33.750
Lolly?

14:33.755 --> 14:36.215
It's definitely not cancer.

14:36.223 --> 14:38.593
Okay. I don't want to
waste my time diagnosing you

14:38.593 --> 14:40.593
if it's going to be some
run of the mill cancer thing.

14:40.594 --> 14:42.464
Who says I need diagnosing?

14:42.463 --> 14:44.033
You're dying.

14:44.031 --> 14:45.301
Painfully, apparently.

14:45.300 --> 14:48.100
And they don't know
why or what of.

14:48.102 --> 14:49.572
It just sounds
pretty undiagnosed to me.

14:49.570 --> 14:52.440
We're all dying, you realize.

14:52.439 --> 14:56.039
Slowly, painfully.
Just a matter of time, friend.

14:56.044 --> 14:58.644
See now, that's the spirit!

14:58.646 --> 15:00.176
Are you scared?

15:00.180 --> 15:02.380
I try not to think about it.

15:02.383 --> 15:03.623
How's that working out
for you?

15:03.617 --> 15:05.377
Not very well.

15:05.386 --> 15:06.746
Are you being survived?

15:06.755 --> 15:08.715
I have no idea
what that means.

15:08.723 --> 15:10.123
Wife, kids?

15:10.125 --> 15:11.255
Okay, you can't say that.

15:11.258 --> 15:12.588
It's "survived by."

15:12.593 --> 15:14.133
It has no other
grammatical context.

15:14.128 --> 15:16.358
Jesus, what are you,
a dying English teacher?

15:16.363 --> 15:17.663
Yeah.

15:17.665 --> 15:19.225
Oh.

15:19.233 --> 15:21.403
That's fair enough, I suppose.

15:21.402 --> 15:23.472
Conjugate me
to your heart's content.

15:23.471 --> 15:25.801
- Conjugation's different...
- Shut up.

15:25.806 --> 15:27.276
Okay.

15:34.049 --> 15:36.419
Are you sure
we haven't met before?

15:37.684 --> 15:40.394
I don't know. Have we?

15:40.387 --> 15:42.687
One shouldn't answer a question
with a question.

15:42.689 --> 15:46.189
One shouldn't be such
a pompous prat, but here we are.

15:48.530 --> 15:50.660
I think I would definitely
remember you if we'd met before.

15:50.665 --> 15:53.425
You would think so,
wouldn't you?

16:12.620 --> 16:14.790
What the fuck is going on?

16:16.657 --> 16:18.457
Who the hell are you?

16:20.462 --> 16:22.362
Untie me.

16:23.598 --> 16:24.728
Now!

16:28.469 --> 16:30.299
Listen to me.

16:30.304 --> 16:33.774
You've made a mistake.
A big one.

16:33.775 --> 16:38.675
But it is a redeemable error.

16:38.679 --> 16:40.379
You're gonna put on
the rest of your clothes,

16:40.381 --> 16:41.481
you're gonna
gather your things,

16:41.482 --> 16:43.552
you're gonna give me the key,

16:43.550 --> 16:48.220
and then you're going
to run for your life.

16:48.223 --> 16:51.663
You've no idea who I am,

16:51.659 --> 16:54.559
what I do,

16:54.561 --> 16:56.661
or who I work for.

16:56.664 --> 17:01.374
Au contraire,
Mr. Nigel Illing.

17:01.368 --> 17:04.168
I know exactly who you are.

17:04.172 --> 17:06.642
I know exactly
what it is you do.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.840
And I know exactly
who you work for.

17:11.346 --> 17:14.806
I also know that you're 44,
5'11", 12 stone,

17:14.816 --> 17:16.516
AB Negative,
a drinker and a smoker,

17:16.518 --> 17:17.818
and you have a healthy appetite

17:17.819 --> 17:20.119
for young hookers
in kinky suspenders.

17:24.626 --> 17:26.726
And when you combine
the information

17:26.728 --> 17:28.388
I have gathered on you
and your habits,

17:28.396 --> 17:31.226
one can deduce exactly
how many drops of laudanum

17:31.232 --> 17:32.902
it requires to render you
unconscious

17:32.901 --> 17:34.701
and relatively docile.

17:36.370 --> 17:40.310
I need a teeny-weeny bit
of information from you

17:40.308 --> 17:43.548
and a small donation.

17:44.878 --> 17:46.708
Okay, what do you want?

17:46.713 --> 17:48.453
You want money?

17:48.448 --> 17:51.848
You want the car?
Listen, you can take it.

17:51.853 --> 17:54.853
You can take it.
Take whatever you want.

17:54.856 --> 17:57.516
Oh, that's a very poor
choice of words.

17:57.524 --> 18:00.294
Help! Help!

18:00.294 --> 18:02.194
Help!

18:13.875 --> 18:17.245
Bless me, Father,
for I have sinned.

18:22.383 --> 18:24.353
So there's this guy, right?

18:24.351 --> 18:25.921
He's creeping
through this house.

18:25.919 --> 18:28.789
It's dark, sinister, creepy.
You get the picture.

18:28.790 --> 18:30.260
Pulls out his gun,

18:30.258 --> 18:31.888
and he goes into the room
with it

18:31.893 --> 18:35.633
held arm's length
in front of him, Vince.

18:35.629 --> 18:37.569
I don't know what to tell you.
It's the pictures.

18:40.601 --> 18:42.671
Right. You walk
into the room, right?

18:42.669 --> 18:44.739
In like a shot.
You clear your corners.

18:44.739 --> 18:46.769
Cleared.
The room is yours, easy.

18:46.773 --> 18:49.843
You don't fucking ease
your gun into the room

18:49.844 --> 18:51.384
without being able
to see anything,

18:51.378 --> 18:53.378
waiting to be shot.

18:53.380 --> 18:54.880
It's stupid.

18:54.882 --> 18:57.552
It's a film, Alf.
It's make-believe.

18:57.551 --> 19:00.851
It's factually inaccurate.
They actually make it up.

19:00.855 --> 19:03.285
It's not as though they've got
some hit man consultant

19:03.290 --> 19:04.590
talking them through
the finer points

19:04.591 --> 19:06.591
of assassinating
other fictitious people.

19:06.594 --> 19:07.964
Yes, but why not?

19:07.962 --> 19:11.362
It would be factually accurate
if they did.

19:11.366 --> 19:12.426
I just realized something.

19:12.433 --> 19:14.633
You're a fucking moron.

19:14.636 --> 19:16.406
Two teas, love!

19:17.938 --> 19:19.678
Oy, bottle blonde!

19:21.376 --> 19:22.576
Two teas.

19:24.745 --> 19:26.445
What's the magic word?

19:31.586 --> 19:34.746
To be fair,
you didn't say "please."

19:34.755 --> 19:38.485
Please, could we have
two tea cups of lovely tea,

19:38.492 --> 19:41.332
a little bit of milk,
two sugars, both builder's,

19:41.328 --> 19:42.458
please, if you don't mind?

19:42.463 --> 19:43.903
Thank you very much.

19:45.332 --> 19:47.402
It will be my pleasure.

19:47.402 --> 19:48.342
Wanker.

19:49.671 --> 19:50.811
Watch this.

19:56.743 --> 20:00.353
Excuse me.
Could I have one of your...

20:00.348 --> 20:02.908
lovely-looking
sticky buns, please?

20:02.916 --> 20:05.576
It's dinner and drinks
at the very least

20:05.586 --> 20:08.346
before you get your hands
on my buns, handsome.

20:08.356 --> 20:11.316
I mix a mean martini,
sugarplum.

20:11.326 --> 20:13.356
In that case,
I'll even butter them for you.

20:13.360 --> 20:16.630
Alfred, would you mind terribly
rejoining me at the table,

20:16.630 --> 20:18.030
pretty please?

20:18.031 --> 20:20.671
Before I break
your fucking neck.

20:20.667 --> 20:21.927
Duty calls.

20:21.935 --> 20:24.265
On the job, are you?

20:28.076 --> 20:29.636
Is there the remotest chance

20:29.644 --> 20:33.084
that you could possibly
calm down a bit?

20:33.080 --> 20:34.980
And what kind of a shithole
is this then, eh?

20:34.982 --> 20:38.482
You said somewhere quiet,
off the beaten track.

20:38.485 --> 20:40.415
So you find the only
late night cafe

20:40.421 --> 20:41.751
open this side
of the precinct.

20:41.755 --> 20:43.415
It's genius.

20:43.424 --> 20:45.924
I thought it might be nice
if we had a cup of tea

20:45.926 --> 20:47.496
while we talked.

20:49.797 --> 20:51.467
Enjoy my buns.

20:56.604 --> 20:57.904
Are you fucking drunk
or something?

20:57.905 --> 20:59.665
<i>No. Why?</i>

20:59.674 --> 21:03.144
<i>Just shut the fuck up!
That's why.</i>

21:03.144 --> 21:05.684
<i>What is
